  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nHeho\nIt would be great if we can hide/show elements based on the group of a user. \ne.g. I add the user to a group via oidc and he can only see elements that he has access to.\nFor this it would be possible to add permissions to the dynamic element of the dashboard or on an app basis.\n\nGreetings\nPhoenix\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
