      "created_at": "2025-09-29T15:25:15Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-09-29T15:25:15Z",
      "body": "Apart from applications we want to share (e.g. jellyfin, jellyseerr, etc) there are administrative applications (e.g. adguard, portainer, etc.).  To prevent non admin users to see urls to the administrative apps which are available in the Apps List I finally ended up with two homarr instances, one instance for ordinary users and second instance for admins. I would like to have the possibility to hide availability of the App List and the Integrations List for non admin users. ",
      "author_association": "NONE",
